OL,3,ACyber-security issue hitting sites
OL,4,Aworldwide prompts 'millions' of hacking
OL,5,Aattempts
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe vulnerability is within the PHP
OL,8,Fprogramming language - it collects
OL,9,Finformation you need and presents it in
OL,10,Fa way you can read on the web. Here's
OL,11,Fhow the saga unfolded
OL,13,FPHP makes up the "invisible
OL,14,Finfrastructure" of the internet, our
OL,15,Fcyber correspondent explains - and a
OL,16,Fleak about the security flaw prompted a
OL,17,F"frenzy in the cyber crime world"
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
